    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch12-42: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.88";
    dc:description "Single-axiom bases for Boolean algebra are finite statements that public automated reasoners can verify decisively. Enumeration also tests the quantitative simplicity claim once the syntax and ordering are fixed.";
