    dc:type "resolution-route/proof";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Parse the proposed six-Nand identity, mechanically prove that it axiomatizes Boolean algebra with Nand, and exhaustively enumerate shorter identities to assess minimality and its rank among systems. A countermodel or failure to derive standard Boolean laws refutes the axiomatization.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Axiom length depends on notation and allowed variables.", "The likelihood claim needs a specified ordering of axiom systems.";
